    {
      "fileName": "fey-fellowship.json",
      "id": "FWCULKnVXhSPL0ST",
      "name": "Fey Fellowship",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "FWCULKnVXhSPL0ST",
        "folder": "iCmY7YHz0Y1zDoPb",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Fey Fellowship",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Your enhanced fey connection (either through your blood or via prolonged contact with their kind) affords you a warmer reception from creatures of the First World as well as tools to foil their tricks or withstand their magic. You gain a +2 circumstance bonus to both Perception checks and saving throws against fey.</p>\n<p>In addition, whenever you meet a fey creature in a social situation, you can immediately attempt a Diplomacy check to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Make an Impression] on that creature rather than needing to converse for 1 minute. You take a –5 penalty to the check. If you fail, you can engage in 1 minute of conversation and attempt a new check at the end of that time rather than accepting the failure or critical failure result.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": []
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core"
          },
          "rules": [
            {
              "key": "FlatModifier",
              "predicate": [
                "target:trait:fey"
              ],
              "selector": "perception",
              "type": "circumstance",
              "value": 2
            },
            {
              "key": "FlatModifier",
              "predicate": [
                "origin:trait:fey"
              ],
              "selector": "saving-throw",
              "type": "circumstance",
              "value": 2
            }
          ],
          "traits": {
