          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You might have a flighty nature, but when a topic captures your attention, you dive into it headfirst. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Additional Lore] feat and the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Assurance] feat for the chosen Lore. As gnome obsessions can come and go quickly, you can retrain Gnome Obsession to a different Lore subcategory in 1 day of downtime.</p>"
          },
